@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+## Why
+
+The school wants to reward customers who stay longer by discounting rentals of 3 days or more.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- A rental of 3 or more days costs 10% less than its full price (daily price × days).
+- The reduced total is what both `quote` and `book` return.
+- Rentals of 1–2 days are unchanged.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+None.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+- `equipment-rental`: the Quote requirement (and thereby Booking, whose total equals the quote) gains a long-stay discount.
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: the shared `price` function.
+- `src/index.test.ts`: new tests.
